    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48523" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεσμο-φόρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>law-giving</i>, epith. of
			Demeter, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.91
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				134
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IPE</u>
				2.13
			</span></i> (Panticapaeum, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Aet.Oxy.</u>
				2079.10
